<chapter xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude" xml:id="getting-started-introduction-index-doc-getting-started-introduction-index">
  <title>Introduction</title>
  <introduction xml:id="getting-started-introduction-index-introduction">
    <p>This series will introduce you to Godot and give you an overview of its
            features.</p>
    <p>In the following pages, we will introduce the engine's most
            essential concepts, run you through the editor's interface, and give you tips to
            make the most of your time learning it.</p>

    </introduction>
